sara: OK I'll draft an intake form with fields: model_name, quant_profile, eval_suite_ids, prompt_templates (with example messages), function_schemas (JSON schema + examples), expected_latency_ms, failure_triggers, rollback_plan. I'll attach a sample API snippet and checklist to the onboarding doc by EOD. Thanks everyone! :pray:
